@startuml SD10_DisconnectOverride
!include _style.iuml
title SD-10  Manual override and disconnect (UC-11, UC-02) — REQ-02, REQ-40

actor Imager
participant ":StatusViewModel" as SVM
participant ":ManualOverride" as Ovr
participant ":MonitorService" as Svc
participant ":AllskySafetyMonitorDevice" as Dev
participant "NINA" as NINA
participant ":NinaMountStateSource" as Mount

== Manual override ==
Imager -> SVM : OverrideMode = ForceUnsafe
SVM -> Ovr : Mode = ForceUnsafe
SVM -> SVM : show override banner
note right of Ovr : Logged; applied to every decision;\nnot persisted — Auto after NINA restart (REQ-40)

== Disconnect (or NINA closing) ==
Imager -> NINA : Disconnect safety monitor
NINA -> Dev : Disconnect()
activate Dev
Dev -> Svc : StopAsync()
activate Svc
Svc -> Svc : cancel token, await loop
Svc --> Dev
deactivate Svc
Dev -> Mount : unregister from ITelescopeMediator
Dev -> Dev : Connected = false, IsSafe = false
Dev --> NINA
deactivate Dev
note over Dev : No separate process or window remains (REQ-02)
@enduml
